[00:01.948]Hear my beat of mind!
{"倾听我内心的节拍！"}
[00:03.818]This will be my new history slang song in mannered panurgy
{"这将是我崭新历史中的风格化泛艺说唱"}
[00:07.282]What did you really want to hear?
{"你究竟想听些什么？"}
[00:09.664](Listen!)
[00:10.648]I tried to find out what you did't do
{"我试图找出你未曾做到的事"}
[00:12.780]So I flip it and bust a hole in you
{"于是我翻转局面 在你身上凿开缺口"}
[00:14.462]Man, how'd you do that?
{"老兄 你怎么做到的？"}
[00:15.534]Rewind the track track
{"倒带回放 轨道轨道"}
[00:16.519]Find out you are whack
{"发现你实在糟糕"}
[00:17.775]I guess I lack intelligence or relevance
{"或许我缺乏才智或关联性"}
[00:20.819]While you try to catch up to me
{"当你试图追赶我时"}
[00:22.300]I'll be costin'
{"我将持续消耗"}
[00:23.374]Don't you see?
{"难道你看不见？"}
[00:26.984](Ha ha!)
[00:30.399](What's up?)
[00:33.285]I feel my heartbeat
{"我感受心跳搏动"}
[00:35.298](Yeah! yeah!)
[00:38.174]Don't be a clown
{"别当小丑"}
[00:39.856]Don't you see everybody's pullin' from town to town
{"难道你看不见人人都在城镇间奔波"}
[00:43.220](Ha ha!)
[00:45.079]Stop the circus
{"停止马戏表演"}
[00:46.329]Get of the train and go get lost
{"下车吧 去迷失方向"}
[00:48.386]Cause you know my rhymes
{"因为你知晓我的韵脚"}
[00:49.885]Always will be the core
{"永远会是核心"}
[00:52.652](Ha ha!)
[00:54.490](Do it now)
[00:57.079]You gonna say what?
{"你想说什么？"}
[00:59.571](Do it now)
[01:03.634]Come on now!
{"来吧 现在！"}
[01:05.551]In my mind, my music's for I not we, you, they, she or that
{"在我心里，我的音乐不为我、你、他们、她或那个"}
[01:08.919]That means I'm talkin' to you
{"那意味着我在对你说话"}
[01:10.328]Get your head out the tunnel cause you already free
{"把头从隧道里探出来，因为你已经自由了"}
[01:11.443](What's up?)
{"（怎么了？）"}
[01:12.099]All used up and washed away
{"全都耗尽，冲刷殆尽"}
[01:13.732]No panic thoughts or a blue Monday
{"没有恐慌的念头，也没有忧郁的星期一"}
[01:15.650]I'll be rockin' what I got, please
{"我会尽情摇摆我所拥有的，拜托"}
[01:17.327]Like TV, you can stay in your place
{"就像电视，你可以待在你的位置"}
[01:19.289]I tried to find out what you didn't do
{"我试图找出你没做的事"}
[01:21.439]So I flip it and bust a hole in you
{"所以我翻转它，在你身上捅个洞"}
[01:23.122]Man, how'd you do that?
{"兄弟，你是怎么做到的？"}
[01:24.099]Rewind the act
{"倒带那行为"}
[01:24.832]A hundred times to see you a whack
{"一百遍，只为看你出丑"}
[01:26.612]I guess I lack intelligence
{"我想我缺乏智慧"}
[01:28.154]Drive round redundance
{"绕着冗余打转"}
[01:29.377]While you catch up to me
{"当你追赶我时"}
[01:30.714]I'll be costin'
{"我会付出代价"}
[01:31.899]Can't you see?
{"你看不到吗？"}
